<title>ITALY: Irresponsible to avoid Italy mini-budget - Veltroni.</title>
<headline>Irresponsible to avoid Italy mini-budget - Veltroni.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Deputy Prime Minister Walter Veltroni said on Thursday it would be &quot;extremely grave and irresponsible&quot; not to pass a mini-budget.</p>
<p>Prime Minister Romano Prodi said on Wednesday that Italy would pass a supplementary package of financial measures to ensure it met the criteria to join a single European currency at its planned start in 1999.</p>
</text>
